: "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nqxJ3Ltu46M/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "Connie Wood | 512.540.2615\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n9206 Susan Drive, KILLEEN, TX\r\n\r\nMap it at https://www.google.com/maps/place/9206+Susan+Drive,+KILLEEN,+TX\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nColdwell Banker\r\n\r\nColdwellBankerHomes.com\r\n\r\nMove-in ready 3-bed, 2-bath in Splawn Ranch — freshly painted and professionally cleaned. Roof replaced May 2025. Bright, open living areas with a functional floor plan that flows from the kitchen to the dining and living spaces, ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen features granite countertops, a center island, a walk-in pantry, and a stainless-steel appliance package. Carpet in the bedrooms and tile throughout the rest of the home. Full-yard automatic sprinkler system. The owner’s retreat is tucked toward the rear for privacy, offers abundant natural light, and includes an en-suite with a double vanity, a walk-in closet, and a large walk-in shower. The spacious backyard provides room for outdoor activities and a blank canvas to create your own oasis. Conveniently located near the front of the subdivision with easy access to Hwy 195 for a quick commute to Austin and Fort Hood, yet tucked away from the hustle and bustle of city life. Great option for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a clean, well-kept property in a desirable location. Room dimensions are approximate; buyer should verify. Call for a private showing.", "channel_id": "UCblhSimaUbM15R-kGm-0J1A", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCblhSimaUbM15R-kGm-0J1A", "duration": 70, "view_count": 17, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nqxJ3Ltu46M", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": ["9206 Susan Drive KILLEEN", "At Home In Central Texas", "ColdwellBankerHomes.com", "Connie Wood", "KILLEEN Real Estate Listing", "KILLEEN TX Homes for Sale", "Realtor", "TX"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_t